      "evidence": "The retained actual application journeys remain clear on desktop and emulated touch-phone layouts: named-room creation drills through bays, rooms and nested contents, while the studio path exposes shelf tiers, individual items, tabletop props, selection, framing, Undo/Redo and recovery. The current local rebuilt object and room journeys pass their complete checks, so this renewal supports the registered user flow without claiming arbitrary room or catalog coverage."
    },
    "accuracy": {
      "grade": "B+",
      "evidence": "The same reciprocal bulk-rule implementation is used by the granular contents graph without changing public WFC matrix meaning. The retained native/browser contents, assembly, extent and world evidence covers 63+252+528+52+68 local checks, 308-building checks, 1,159+10,071 integration checks and 4,609 house profiles; current local object and room/recovery journeys pass 188 and 24 checks. Existing deep-transform, support-contact, lock, explicit removal, food and picking evidence remains applicable because the change is confined to graph rule construction and detached arrays. Canonical Linux metadata has zero grouping-membership changes and a maximum bounds delta of 1.1920928955078125e-7."
    },
    "wowFactor": {
      "grade": "B+",
      "evidence": "The inspected retained captures show populated cabins and rooms, close object views, distinct nested contents and readable phone controls with coherent Phanes materials and grounding. The current contents rule optimization preserves the same public WFC matrix and current object/room rendered outputs; broad product aesthetics and physical-device performance remain outside these feature scopes."
    },
    "thinkingOutOfTheBox": {
      "grade": "A-",
      "evidence": "The feature combines explicit composition identity, measured supports and nested ownership with bounded local WFC graphs, reciprocal bulk rules and detached value arrays. This keeps public solver semantics while removing redundant per-pair graph synchronization, and the same data survives save, undo, selection and graphics recovery in the integrated journeys."
    }
